A '''trainer''' was a type of [[starship]] used for the training of [[pilot]]s. The [[RZ-1T trainer]] was a model of [[RZ-1 A-wing interceptor|A-wing]] trainer developed during the early rebellion against the [[Galactic Empire]] which,<ref name="RZ-1T">{{Databank|a-wing-trainer-rz-1t|A-wing trainer (RZ-1T)}}</ref> unlike the base RZ-1,<ref name="RotJ">{{Film|VI}}</ref> featured an instructor's seat at the back of the [[cockpit]].<ref name="RZ-1T" />

